# Ignore specific session dates  (2026-08-18)
# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Some sessions are not assessments of the student's own clinical work and must
# not feed any threshold, average or count. Student-on-student activities are the
# case that prompted this: the student practises on a classmate, so entrustment /
# GR / patient numbers from that day say nothing about their clinical progress,
# and leaving them in drags every cohort average around.
#
# The mechanism is generic — pass any list of dates to createFlaggingReport's
# ``ignoreDates``. The DDS2 clinic list below is just a named, documented default
# you can point at.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
